# ==============================================================================
# Unmuted - Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# Unmuted utilizes Firebase App Check, Cloud Firestore, Firebase Storage,
# and Firebase AI Logic (Gemini 3.8 Flash). No hardcoded Gemini API keys are needed
# because requests are authenticated on-device via Firebase App Check tokens.
#
# To pass a registered Firebase App Check Debug Token during local emulator or
# device testing, supply your UUID debug token below or pass via intent extra:
# adb shell am start -e FIREBASE_APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN "<your-debug-token>"
FIREBASE_APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN=
